<title>UK: Bankgesellschaft unit $200 mln two-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Bankgesellschaft unit $200 mln two-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE IRELAND</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    21.JUL.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.876   PAY DATE    21.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.876    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10    SALE LIMITS US/GB/IE/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.25 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 31.MAY.99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
